  /* EA Literacy Stages 4 to 7: Phonics into spelling. The same 36 sound blocks are taught at every stage, from the
     simpler code (Stages 4-5) to the complex code (Stages 6-7), so each stop has the same blocks with harder words.
     Block 35 (the ch in loch and other Scots words) has no online list: the voice can't say that sound. */
